  "description": "Sarang, a fan of idol Eternal, is shocked by an article on Eternal's social media page one day, and when she wakes up, she finds herself back in the past, a year earlier.  \nSarang, the idol who betrayed her trust, cleaned up her act and became a public school student with integrity.  \nBut... when I woke up, it was a year ago again.\n\nA love trapped in a loop that keeps repeating. And the only thing that changes in it is eternity. Are loops and eternity related?\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=817371), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?originalProductId=531635)",
